    "note_tweet": {
      "entities": {},
      "text": "Since August 12, 2026, Bilibili, one of the largest video platforms in China, censored/removed at least thirty videos (some uploaded years ago) by trans creators that contain ordinary content about employment, daily life, clothing, hormone therapy, medication, and blood-test results. Bilibili classified the videos as “highly controversial” and labeled these videos as containing materials associated with “gender conflict” and “non-mainstream” relationship values."
    },
